      "content": "Modeled from the public Benevity API documentation at developer.benevity.org. Covers the confirmed Causes, Giving (donations), Receipts, and Spark (giving/volunteer opportunities) endpoints. Credentials are partner-gated (request-a-demo); this document reflects publicly documented paths and fields only - it does not fabricate an unverified full surface. The Location Services API is intentionally omitted here (see review.yml) because its exact request/response schema beyond the overview guide was not independently confirmed.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Benevity",
